@lang pt
IMPORT prelude

GIVEN `o agente` IS A NUMBER
      `a vítima` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg:en P1 %o agente% older than %a vítima%
`regra p1` `o agente` `a vítima` MEANS `o agente` GREATER THAN `a vítima`

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      v IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg:en P2 %a% older than %v%
a `é mais velho que` v MEANS a GREATER THAN v

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg:en P3 the agent's age %a% is at least 18
`maior de idade` a MEANS a AT LEAST 18

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg:en P4 an increase of 50% applies
`regra p4` a MEANS a AT LEAST 18

#EVAL `regra p1` 30 20
#EVAL 30 `é mais velho que` 20
#EVAL `maior de idade` 20
#EVAL `regra p4` 20
